text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#393349;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.15em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">transcendence of time/</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px; line-height:1.4em; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#393349;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.15em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">call for collective liberation/</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px; line-height:1.4em; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#393349;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.15em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&nbsp;+ </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:21px; line-height:1.4em; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:21px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#393349;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.15em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">chicken soup, served by Mia all outside and socially distanced.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:22px; line-height:1.4em; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#393349;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.15em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.4em; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#393349;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.15em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">We imagine that the weekend, a mere 4 days after the election, will be a&nbsp;profound&nbsp;time of upheaval, possibility, or uncertainty. </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:1.4em; text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#393349;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:avenir-lt-w01_35-light1475496,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.15em;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">It will be a time to safely gather.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p>",
